\newlabel{fig:kin_planes}{{3.2}{10}{\small Kinematics of the process $pd\rightarrow ppn$ in the rest frame of the deuteron $d$ with the $z$-axis pointing along the momentum of the incoming proton $p_{1}$. Notations for the particles' four-momenta are the same as in Fig.~\ref {fig:diagram}. Kinematic variables $\phi $ and $t$ are described in the text.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
